---
import BaseLayout from '@layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import ContactCTA from '@components/ContactCTA.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="How We Work: Long-Term Software Partnerships"
  description="We don't do projects. We do partnerships. Our embedded model means the engineer who builds your system is the one who supports it, for years."
>
  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="bg-white py-20">
    <div class="container mx-auto px-6">
      <div class="max-w-3xl">
        <h1 class="font-heading text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-charcoal mb-6">
          We don't do projects. We do partnerships.
        </h1>
        <p class="text-xl text-charcoal-light leading-relaxed">
          Most software companies scope a project, build it, hand it off, and move on. That works for a marketing website. It doesn't work for a manufacturing plant, because your plant changes. New products, new customers, new regulations, new equipment. Your software needs to evolve with you.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Three Phases -->
  <section class="py-20">
    <div class="container mx-auto px-6">
      <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
        <h2 class="font-heading text-3xl font-bold mb-12 text-center">How It Works</h2>
        
        <div class="space-y-16">
          <!-- Phase 1 -->
          <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-8 items-start">
            <div class="flex-shrink-0 bg-copper text-white w-16 h-16 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-heading text-2xl font-bold">
              1
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="font-heading text-2xl font-bold mb-4">Understand</h3>
              <p class="text-lg text-charcoal-light leading-relaxed">
                We spend time on your plant floor. We watch your operators, talk to your supervisors, and learn your process. We don't start with a requirements document. We start with understanding. Before we write a line of code, we know what a normal day looks like, where things break down, and what keeps your team up at night.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Phase 2 -->
          <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-8 items-start">
            <div class="flex-shrink-0 bg-copper text-white w-16 h-16 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-heading text-2xl font-bold">
              2
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="font-heading text-2xl font-bold mb-4">Build the Foundation</h3>
              <p class="text-lg text-charcoal-light leading-relaxed">
                We start where the pain is worst: usually one or two critical areas. We build, deploy, and iterate until it's right. Then we expand. There's no big-bang rollout. Every phase delivers real value to your operation before we move to the next one.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Phase 3 -->
          <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-8 items-start">
            <div class="flex-shrink-0 bg-copper text-white w-16 h-16 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-heading text-2xl font-bold">
              3
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="font-heading text-2xl font-bold mb-4">Grow Together</h3>
              <p class="text-lg text-charcoal-light leading-relaxed">
                Over months and years, we extend coverage across your operation. Each new system connects to what's already there. Your software grows as your business grows.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- What We Don't Do -->
  <section class="py-20">
    <div class="container mx-auto px-6">
      <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
        <h2 class="font-heading text-3xl font-bold mb-8 text-center">An honest word about fit</h2>
        <div class="bg-white border border-charcoal/10 rounded-lg p-8">
          <p class="text-lg text-charcoal-light leading-relaxed text-center">
            We partner with manufacturers who want a long-term software relationship, 
            and if that's not what you need to solve your problems, we'll tell you. 
            Even if it means you don't work with us. Even if we have already spent time talking 
            through the problems you need to solve.
          </p>

          <p class="text-lg text-charcoal-light leading-relaxed text-center mt-6">
          We're not the right fit for everyone, but for others, we're the best.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA -->
  <section class="py-16">
    <div class="container mx-auto px-6">
      <ContactCTA />
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
